description:
Combine .gitignore templates (based on github/gitignore) for languages, frameworks, tools, editors and operating systems into one deduplicated file, optionally test paths against it. Template ids: node, python, django, jupyter, java, maven, gradle, kotlin, android, go, rust, ruby, rails, php, laravel, dotnet, c, cpp, swift, flutter, elixir, scala, r, nextjs, terraform, unity, docker, secrets, vscode, jetbrains, visualstudio, eclipse, vim, emacs, sublime, macos, windows, linux.

Returns: JSON { content (.gitignore text), unknownTemplates[], duplicatesRemoved, tests[{ path, ignored, rule{pattern,line,negate}, via }] }.
Example input: {"templates":["node","macos","vscode"],"testPaths":[".env","node_modules/x.js",".vscode/settings.json"]}
